class {}

<ebay-video
    width="600"
    height="400"
    layout="compact"
    autoplay
    loop
    thumbnail="https://i.ebayimg.com/images/g/EvEAAeSw3oFos1hF/s-l500.webp"
    on-load-error(
        (err) => {
            console.log("handle error", err);
        },
    )
>
    <@source src="https://videoservices.vip.qa.ebay.com/videos/v1/52fced381990ad72e301760efffffef8/playlist.mpd"/>
</ebay-video>

<p>This example demonstrates customizing the video player controls:</p>
<ul>
    <li>Added a big play button (add-big-play-button=true)</li>
    <li>Enabled the seek bar (add-seek-bar=true)</li>
    <li>Customized control panel elements (removed "report" and "total_time" from the default set)</li>
</ul>
